			"Message": "style(Mountain): Apply consistent formatting across command handlers, IPC dispatchers, and environment providers\n\nStandardize whitespace and formatting across Mountain's command registration, language feature providers, SCM integration, tree view handlers, document provider, file watcher, keybinding commands, native host dialogs, and WindServiceHandlers dispatcher modules:\n\n- Remove extraneous blank lines after function signatures, struct definitions, impl blocks, and match arms across 200+ files\n- Normalize import organization: group use declarations, remove trailing blank lines\n- Condense single-statement methods and lock acquisition patterns to single-line format\n- Standardize dev_log! macro argument alignment and line breaks across provider handlers\n- Fix struct field spacing in DTOs and response types\n- Introduce UICommandDispatcher for decorations, commands, and extensions command routing\n- Refactor dispatcher modules to use consistent match expression formatting with inline arms\n\nNo functional changes — purely mechanical formatting cleanup for consistency across Mountain's command layer, IPC dispatchers, environment providers, and service handlers.",
